# claude-code-pack-verify project ontology — deliberately empty of individuals.
#
# claude-code-pack's own ontology.ttl (packs/claude-code-pack/ontology.ttl) is a
# complete, closed model of the ccw:Workflow/ccw:Phase/ccw:AgentJob/ccw:Agent/
# ccw:Skill individuals its four templates query; this consumer adds no
# project-specific facts on top of it (mirrors examples/rmcp-verify/schema/domain.ttl's
# and examples/star-toml-verify/schema/domain.ttl's same posture — confirmed by
# reading packs/claude-code-pack/templates/*.tmpl's sparql: blocks, all of which
# select only from hardcoded ccw: IRIs owned by the pack's own ontology). This file
# exists only to satisfy `[ontology] source` in ggen.toml — the real domain facts
# come entirely from the wired pack.

@prefix ccw:  <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/claude-code#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
